---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { GITHUB_URL, LINKEDIN_URL } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Marcus (Chia Xin Liang) — engineer writing about LLMs and AI systems performance."
	pubDate={new Date('September 12 2026')}
>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm <strong>Marcus (Chia Xin Liang)</strong>. I'm an engineer focused on
		large language models and the systems that make them fast: GPUs, CUDA,
		inference serving, and everything in between.
	</p>

	<p>This site contains learning paths in 3 areas:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>AI Infrastructure</strong> — measurement, hardware capacity, networking, kernels, distributed training, and LLM serving.</li>
		<li><strong>Models & Mathematics</strong> — neural networks, statistical learning, Transformers, and modern model architectures.</li>
		<li><strong>Hardware & Co-Design</strong> — computer architecture, Arm and RISC-V, ASICs, accelerators, and efficient AI.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>Browse the <a href="/blog/">series catalog</a>. Series carry subject and level tags, with at most 30 articles.</p>

	<p>
		Every article follows the same rules: one concept at a time, concrete numbers
		over adjectives, original diagrams, and primary sources cited.
	</p>

	<p>
		Find me on <a href={GITHUB_URL} target="_blank">GitHub</a> and
		<a href={LINKEDIN_URL} target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>, or subscribe via
		<a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
